From 8398a6784dcb0f50c547b2329a13115a2053f446 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DanielBeeck <daniel.beck99@outlook.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 16:41:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] Add a factory reset for onboard profiles

ratbag_device_factory_reset() asks the driver to restore the profiles the
device shipped with and re-read them; the hidpp20 driver implements it by
loading the ROM profiles into the user slots and writing them back with a
regular commit, so only the well tested write path is used. ratbagd
exposes it as Device.FactoryReset() -> u and emits Resync afterwards.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
