+/**
+ * @ingroup device
+ *
+ * Restore the onboard profiles of the device to the factory defaults, i.e.
+ * the profiles the device shipped with, and discard all pending changes.
+ * Depending on the device, this may take a couple of seconds. All profile,
+ * resolution, button and LED objects of the device must be re-read
+ * afterwards.
+ *
+ * @param device A previously initialized ratbag device
+ * @return 0 on success or an error code otherwise
+ * @retval RATBAG_ERROR_CAPABILITY The device does not support a factory
+ * reset
+ */
